lish Conversation Circle – Forest Hill Library\n	\n\n\n														\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Practice English in small groups\, with the support of our Mentors! 8 weekly sessions Speak with confidence […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Tue		\n		\n			3		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		Citizenship Education Circle – Toronto Reference Library	\n\n					\n		\n		March 3 @ 6:00 pm - 8:30 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		Citizenship Education Circle – Toronto Reference Library\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		Toronto Reference Library	\n	\n		789 Yonge Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Every Tuesday at the Toronto Reference Library there will be free weekly sessions to prepare for the […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Wed		\n		\n			4		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n	Postponed\n\n\n	\n		Networking Event with TD Canada Trust	\n\n					\n		\n		March 4 @ 1:00 pm - 3:30 pm	\n	\n														\n\n				\n	Come join us for a networking session with TD Canada Trust! Who can participate: Internationally trained professionals Permanent Resident or Convention Refugee At least 19 years of age Job-ready English […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Wed		\n		\n			4		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		Create Learn Connect	\n\n					\n		\n		March 4 @ 2:00 pm - 4:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		Create Learn Connect\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		Cecil Street Community Centre	\n	\n		58 Cecil Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Nurture Your Artistic Potential! Our thoughtfully designed Art Workshops encourage creativity\, focus\, and growth Participants must be a Permanent Resident or Convention Refugee and at least 19 years old. To […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Wed		\n		\n			4		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		Citizenship Education Circle – Online	\n\n					\n		\n		March 4 @ 7:00 pm - 9:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		Citizenship Education Circle – Online\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		Online	\n	\n			\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Join our free weekly online sessions for Newcomers who want to prepare for the Citizenship test! Learn […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Thu		\n		\n			5		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		G1 Driving Test Classes for Newcomers	\n\n					\n		\n		March 5 @ 2:00 pm - 4:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		G1 Driving Test Classes for Newcomers\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		CultureLink	\n	\n		2340 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Get ready to pass your Ontario G1 Knowledge Test for Free! Program Highlights: Instructor-led\, easy-to-follow lessons MTO-approved materials Supportive and welcoming learning environment Ideal for first-time drivers and newcomers Who […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Thu		\n		\n			5		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		Content Creation for Success	\n\n					\n		\n		March 5 @ 4:00 pm - 5:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		Content Creation for Success\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		CultureLink Children & Youth Centre	\n	\n		3535 Dundas Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Free Workshops For Youth\, Ages 16-30 Learn directly from real influencers! Live Q&A - ask creators anything (growth\, money\, fame) Secrets behind viral videos + follower growth Film + edit […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Thu		\n		\n			5		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		English Conversation Circle – New Toronto Library	\n\n					\n		\n		March 5 @ 6:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		English Conversation Circle – New Toronto Library\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		New Toronto Library	\n	\n		110 Eleventh Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Practice English in small groups\, with the support of our Mentors! 8 weekly sessions Speak with confidence […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Thu		\n		\n			5		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		Interacthon at Mimico Library	\n\n					\n		\n		March 5 @ 6:00 pm - 7:30 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		Interacthon at Mimico Library\n	\n\n\n														\n\n				\n	Come join our Interacthon! Talk\, Connect\, Practice English A marathon of interactive recreational\, social and informational activities for newcomers and community members! What's in it for you? Try new activities […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Mon		\n		\n			9		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		English Conversation Circle – North York Central Library	\n\n					\n		\n		March 9 @ 2:00 pm - 4:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		English Conversation Circle – North York Central Library\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		North York Central Library	\n	\n		5120 Yonge Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Every Monday at the North York Central Library there will be free weekly sessions to prepare for […] \n\n				\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n\n							\n				\n				\n\n	\n	\n		\n			Mon		\n		\n			9		\n	\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n	\n\n\n			\n\n				\n					\n	\n		English Conversation Circle – Bloor/Gladstone Library	\n\n					\n		\n		March 9 @ 6:00 pm - 8:00 pm	\n	\n\n	\n		\n\n	\n	\n	\n\n		English Conversation Circle – Bloor/Gladstone Library\n	\n\n\n					\n	\n		Bloor/Gladstone Library	\n	\n		1101 Bloor Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada	\n	\n									\n\n				\n	Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? Practice English in small groups\, with the 